{"id":632574862,"name":"Eclipsis","desc":"Eclipsis is in alpha, expect bugs and incomplete features.\nPrivate servers let you customize all kinds of match settings and play unrated matches.\n\nA few hundred light-years away from Earth is the world of Eclipsis. Here, you are a mercenary fighting to secure supplies of Iridium for a mega corporation that hired you. Defeat your opponents by utilizing this wondrous material to build defenses, weapons, gadgets, and vehicles. Weave pipelines through the ruins of an ancient alien civilization as you dominate your foes.\n\nOne must wonder, though, what brought the end of this world's original owners. Who knows? At least you're getting paid.\n\nPremium Benefits:\n- One extra daily quest","path":"/game/632574862-eclipsis","slug":"632574862-eclipsis","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/0b1d639cfed032a17f566d20ad99db0a1d5c4d90922bfdd48c0f07e2e3fc3824.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-e2bdddc24c8c28f9f9efc135ae59d08d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":11,"visitor":17952567,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2022-01-16T02:19:43.907Z","creator":{"name":"F.F.T.L","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"GUI_317","_id":"61e380bfdb8d0cfb4251e3de","title":"GUI","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c786e4","gameId":632574862,"name":"Eclipsis","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":632574862},"features":"Auto iridium\nNo fall/sea dmg\nCtrlTp\nSpawn ESP\nESP\nNo Sea\nFull Bright\nAimbot [R]\nChat Spy\nStructure TP\nGun mod","tags":["Eclipsis","GUI"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkswlorn/My-Repo/main/EclipsisGUI\", true))()","owner":{"_id":"61e37fef747c300501828f93","username":"viral","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/no-profile.webp","original